        "row_stretch": "default",
        "code": "<section class=\"hero-banner\">\n  <div class=\"hero-overlay\">\n    <div class=\"hero-content\">\n      <h1>\n        Since many of our customers are buying direct from the farm for the first time, we wanted to put together an F.A.Q. page to help answer any questions you may have!\n      </h1>\n\n      <div class=\"quote-mark\">-</div>\n\n      <p class=\"author\">\n        BORN . Raised . PROCESSED IN THE USA\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.hero-banner {\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 100%;\n  background: url(\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0529/2376/0823/files/JTEszqY-rZYL06MUK-qDl1rdL5dZwtTRce2lW6LMIRg8fb7AGjx-Hb5lMUiXsEsMBXl7dYYw3Mah4W1givr5woX8CrohgZ1m0B_aau7sjM20pGKxTy0NhTaxEsZib-VC1wpA81CkLq9Zp-YgULHIn7wvJr8Sf1akoJKOvQiaNPeRhi6am11ZYHW.jpg?v=1781245264\") center center/cover no-repeat;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.hero-overlay {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    90deg,\n    rgba(245, 239, 228, 0.95) 0%,\n    rgba(245, 239, 228, 0.75) 35%,\n    rgba(245, 239, 228, 0.05) 100%\n  );\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.hero-content {\n      max-width: 650px;\n    margin-left: 70px;\n    padding: 30px 0;\n}\n\n.hero-content h1 {\n  font-family: Impact, \"Arial Narrow\", sans-serif;\n  font-size: 36px;\n  line-height: 1.08;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: #0b2757;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.quote-mark {\n  font-size: 180px;\n  color: #0b2757;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-top: 30px;\n  font-family: Georgia, serif;\n}\n\n.author {\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #0b2757;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-top: -40px;\n}\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n.hero-content {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    margin-left: 30px;\n    padding: 30px 0;\n}\n.hero-content h1 {\n    font-size: 20px;\n}\n.quote-mark {\nmargin-top: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 30px;\n    font-size: 90px;\n}